      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TERRIFIC DAVE (5) quickly into stride to win over the 395m at this track two runs back then raced on speed again when finishing third at Angle Park last start. Deserves serious consideration. HERE COMES RHEA (1) did a good job to finish third last time out over 342m at Angle Park (19.81) in a Grade 6, the second top-three finish on the trot. Can feature with the right run. VICTA WALLY (3) has found the minor placings here at last couple of runs, finishing second last time beaten 4.5 lengths (25.76). Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Well-placed to take this out. ADHANA SNAPPY (7) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
